            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 16,
              "start": 16
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court concluded that invalidating the California regulations would likely redress at least some of the fuel producers\u2019 monetary injuries."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b5d7daa366245deda468df4b5f19d0cc00a08aeeada5d83c308abad031571c2a",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-b5d7daa36624-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court declined to adopt a heightened proof\u2011of\u2011redressability rule, noting that such a rule would close the courthouse doors to many challenges to agency action."
      }
    ],
