            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas asked the petitioners to articulate a categorical rule for when a government denial of market participation is redressable."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
