            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Sotomayor, justice Sotomayor questioned whether the case sought an advisory opinion rather than actual relief."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "05f2a4cd4aa661bb34fc5eed40dbcedbaee6f16ba85e0d323d6e65ffb6ea0a0d",
