        "text": "By recognizing that invalidating the California waiver would likely reduce gasoline sales, the Court acknowledged a concrete monetary injury to fuel producers."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "b5d7daa366245deda468df4b5f19d0cc00a08aeeada5d83c308abad031571c2a",
